bali.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé amna mbir yo meuna def nguir meuna tambali.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2505,"row":{"en":"She is still friends with her former boyfriend, Tom.","wo":"Ba leegi minga xaritoo ak Tom, faram bawoon.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBa légui mingua kharito ak Tom faram bawoon.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2506,"row":{"en":"But then, I notice a movement in the shadows.","wo":"Waaye bima xoolaatee ma gis luy yëngu ci lëndëm gi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWayé bima kholaté ma guiss louy yeungue thi leundeum gui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2507,"row":{"en":"Five-hours-stuck-in-the-Mexican-desert tough would be an accurate description.","wo":"Juroomi waxtuy tenku ci biir deseru Mexik bi, lolou mooy tektal bu dëggu bi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiouromi wakhtouy tenkou thi biir désertou mexique bi lolou moy tektal bou deugue bi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2508,"row":{"en":"At the reunion, Bella finally found the strength to stand up for herself.","wo":"Ci ndaje ma, Bella dafa takk fitam daal di xeex ay yelleefam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi ndadje ma, Bella dafa tak fitam daldi khekh ay yellefam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2509,"row":{"en":"Does such an entity deserve congratulations?","wo":"Ndax bereb bu mel nii jarnaa sargal ?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nNdakh bereub bou mel nii djarnaa sargal ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2510,"row":{"en":"One of the most important aspects of hippie music was its emphasis on balance.","wo":"Benn ci mbir yi gënoon fës ci wàllu hippie mooy dañu bëggoon yamale.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi mbir yi geunone feuss thi wallou hippie moy daniou beugone yamalé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2511,"row":{"en":"The intention is to display ads (via third-party services) that are