ncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2552,"row":{"en":"He had been in a lot of wars, and he had seen a lot of death and destruction.","wo":"Defna xare yu bari, te bari bakkan yu rot yumu gis ak yàqu-yàqu yudul jeex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDefna kharé you bari té bari bakane you rot youmou guiss ak yakhou yakhou you doul diékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2553,"row":{"en":"Visiting Scholar submissions are accepted on an ongoing basis.","wo":"Këyit yi ndongo yiy gëstu dugal, ñu ngi leen di nangu ci base yuy wéy.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKeyit yi ndongo yiy guestou dougal, gnoungui léne di nangou si base youy way.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2554,"row":{"en":"We must reject the forces of division and hate.","wo":"Waru nu nangu lenn dinu xaajale wala nuy bañante.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nWarou gnou nangou lenn dinou khadjale wala nouy bagnanté.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2555,"row":{"en":"The tree was covered in golden apples, and Rajiv had never seen anything like it before.","wo":"Garab gaa ngi fees dell ak pomme yu am melo wurus, te Rajiv musul a gis lu mel noonu ci dundam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGarab ga ngui fess dell ak pomme you ame melo wourouss té Rajiv missoul a guiss lou mel nonou thi doundam.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2556,"row":{"en":"As I walked through the museum, I thought about all the things that had changed in the world since these toys were made.","wo":"Li may nekk ci biir muse bi, may xalaat li jota soppiku ci àdduna bi, biñu defaree fowukaay yooyu ak leegi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima nekk thi biir musée bi may khalaat li diota sopikou thi addouna bi bignou defaré fowoukay yoyou ak légui.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2557,"row":{"en":"I wanted to be able to raise a family in a place where I knew everyone and everyone knew me.","wo":"Lima bëggoon mooy yar sama njaboot ci barab buma xamante ak ñépp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLima beugone moy yar sama ndiabote si barab bouma khamanté ak gneupé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2558,"row":{"en":"Pet-friendly apartment community boasts stunning mountain and city views.","wo":"Dëkkandoo yi and ak ay malay kër taggnañu tund yu neexa xool yi at anam yuñuy gise taax yi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeukando yi ande ak ay malay keur tagne nagnou tound you neukha khol yi ak anam yougnouy guissé takh yi.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2559,"row":{"en":"I finally had to take my computer to a repair shop, and they had to wipe the whole thing and reinstall Windows.","wo":"Dama mujjee dem ci ñiy defar ordinatër, ñu mujjee formaate masin bi yépp ba noppi sampaat ci Windows.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDama moudié dem thi gniy defar ordinateur, gnou moudié formaté machine bi yeup ba noppi sampaate thi windows.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2560,"row":{"en":"When a seed lands in a suitable location, it can germinate and begin the process of growth all over again.","wo":"Su jiwwu wi daanoo fumu mëna saxee, dafay daal di jebbi ba noppi daal di tàmbali màggaat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSou djiiw wi danoo foum meuna sakhe dafay daal di diebi ba nopi daal di tambali magaat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2561,"row":{"en":"You will literally learn how to eat breakfast, lunch, and dinner.","wo":"Di nga jàng bu baax ni ñuy lekkee ndékki, añ ak reer.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDi nga diangue bou bakh ni gnouy lekeu ndekki agne ak réér.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2562,"row":{"en":"He was an avid reader and would often spend hours in the library or curled up in his favorite chair with a good book.","wo":"Ku bëggoon lire la, mënoon na toog ay waxtu bibliotek bi wala mu toog ci toogukaay bimu taamu yor téere bu neex.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKou beugone lire la meunone na tog ay wakhtou bibliotheque bi wala mou tog si togoukay bimmou tamou yorr téré bou nékh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2563,"row":{"en":"To my husband, she said. He was a good man, and he will be missed. But he's in a better place now, and we'll see him again someday.","wo":"Mu wax, Maa ngi koy may sama jëkër. Nit ku baax la woon, te dinaa ko namm. Waaye mingi ci barab bu gën, te bis dina jot nu gisantewaat.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMou wakh, Maa ngui koy may sama dieukeur. Nitt kou bakh la wone té dina ko namme. Wayé mingui thi barab bou gueune té biss dina diote niou guisantéwate.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2564,"row":{"en":"It's important to remember that integrity is one of the most important things in life.","wo":"Bu leen fàtte ni njub bokk na ci mbir yi gëna am solo ci àdduna.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBoulen faté ni ndioub bokk na thi mbir yi geuna am solo si aduna.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2565,"row":{"en":"It is also a great addition to a summer picnic or potluck.","wo":"Dina am solo lool ci kuy piknik ci ete bi wala ñu bëgga bokk seen lekk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDina ame solo lol thi kouy piknik thi été bi wala gnou beuga bok sen lekk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2566,"row":{"en":"I was always curious to see what would happen next.","wo":"Yàkkamti woon naa xam li ci topp.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nYakamti wone naa kham li thi topé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2567,"row":{"en":"As they got closer, they could see that it was coming from a small, glowing sphere.","wo":"Lu ñuy gëna jegesi, ñuy gis ni ci bul bu ndaw bu leer la doon joge.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLou gnuy geuna diegueusi gnuy guiss ni thi boul bou ndaw bou leer la done diogé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2568,"row":{"en":"I'm not sure how long he can keep this up, but I'm kind of impressed by his dedication.","wo":"Xamuma ba kañ lay mëna wéy ci lii, waaye yitte ji mi boole yéem nama.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhamouma ba kan lay meuna waye si lii wayé yité dji mi boolé yéme nama\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2569,"row":{"en":"From the battlefields of antiquity to the modern racetrack, horses have played a vital role in our history.","wo":"Li dalee ci tooli xare ya ca jamonoy antiquite ba ci fi ñuy defee kursu, fas dafa yàgga def jaloore ci taarix.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLi dalé thi toli kharé ya thia diamonoy antiquité ba thi fi niouy défé coursou, fass dafa yague def djalooré thi taarikh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2570,"row":{"en":"Enjoy your Tuesday evening, everyone ... see you here again very soon!","wo":"Banneexulen ci sen allarba ngoon, yen ñëpp …ñu gise ci jammu ci lu yaggul dara!","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBanékhouléne thi séne allarba ngone, yéne gneup... gnou guissé si diamou si lou yagoule dara!\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2571,"row":{"en":"She had an emergency surgery, her jaw was wired shut, and she was on a liquid diet for six weeks.","wo":"Defalon nañuko ab doxalinu paj bu jamp, deñu yeewon ngaamam, banga xamni mungidon dundee lu ndoxe ci dirrub ay ayu bës.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDéffalon nagnouko ab dokhalinou path bou djamp dégnou yéwone ngamam banga khamni mounguidone doundé lou ndokhé thi dirou ay ayou beuss.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2572,"row":{"en":"The dog's owner has said that he was unaware of any history of aggression in the dog, and that he believes the attack was triggered by the grandmother's sudden movement.","wo":"Boroom xaj bi dafa wax ni musul yëg fu xaj bi musee song nit, mu dolli ci ni dafa yaakaar ni li yaay jekki rek yëngu moo tiital xaj moo tax mu song ko.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBorom khadj bi dafa wakh ni meusoul yeug fou khadj bi musée sonn nitt, mou dolli thi ni dafa yakar ni li yay dieuki rek yeungou mo tital khadj mo takh mou sonko.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2573,"row":{"en":"Optional active safety features include blind spot monitoring, lane departure warning, and rear cross traffic alert.","wo":"Ay paccu kaaraange gu takku gi bokkuna ci di wottu bërëb yuñudul gis yi, di fësal fa yoon yii soxxeko, ak dem ak dikk bi faral di am ci ginnaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nAy pathiou kaarangé gou takou gui bokouna thi di wottou beureub yougnoudoul guiss yi, di feussal fa yone yii sokheko, ak dem ak dikk bi faral di ame thi guinaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2574,"row":{"en":"Use a single address label that has clear, complete delivery and return information.","wo":"Jëfandikool benn etiketu adres bu ànd ak adresu delloo bu leer te mat sëkk.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ndieufandiko bene étiquette adresse bou and ak adressou dello bou leer té mat seuk.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2575,"row":{"en":"* 1/4 cup packed light brown sugar","wo":"* 1/4 kaasu suukër bu maroŋ bu leer","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\n1/4 kaassou soukeur bou maron bou leer\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2576,"row":{"en":"She is a beautiful young woman with a sharp wit and a rebellious streak.","wo":"Xale bu jigéen bu rafet la, xel mi ñaw ba noppi ànd ak xadar.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKhalé bou djiguéne bou raféte la, khel mi gnaw ba nopi ande ak khadar.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2577,"row":{"en":"Rub this mixture all over the pork belly.","wo":"Jëlal njaxas moomu nga diw ko ci dënnu mbaam mi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\ndieulal gnakhass momou nga diw ko thi deuneu mbam mi\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2578,"row":{"en":"They continued to be best friends, even though they lived far apart.","wo":"Ñu wéy di nekk ay xarit doonte fi ñu dëkk soreyaante na.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nGnou weuy di nekk ay kharit donté fi gnou deuk soreyanté na.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2579,"row":{"en":"David shows examples of prone, sitting, and standing positions.","wo":"David dafay wane misaali position tëdd, toog ak taxaw.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDavid dafay wané missal position teudd, togue ak takhaw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2580,"row":{"en":"Sober living homes also serve as stepping stones to modern society for recently released prison or jail prisoners.","wo":"Dëkkuwaay yu xumbul noonu, ñooy xeetu dëkkuwaay yiñ wara xalaat ni moo méngoo ak yi baax ci ñiy sooga génn kaso.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDeukouway you khoumboul nonou gnoy khettou deukouway yign wara khalaat ni mo mengoo ak yi bakh thi gniiy soga guenn kaso.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2581,"row":{"en":"Excuse me, Klaus said. What are you doing?","wo":"Klaus ni ko Nga baal ma, looy def nii?","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKlaus niko nga balma loy def nii ?\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2582,"row":{"en":"The clacking is getting louder.","wo":"Bruit baa ngi gëna am doole.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBruit ba ngui geuna ame dolé.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2583,"row":{"en":"See the sights, hear the sounds, and smell the smells of your chosen place.","wo":"Xoolal li fa am lépp, déglul son yi, xeeñtul xet yu neex yi ci barab bi nga tànn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nKholal li fa am lép dégloul son yi khégntoul khét you nékh yi si barab bi nga tane.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2584,"row":{"en":"Floods can also be caused by dams or levees breaking, or by tsunamis.","wo":"Leneen li mëna waral mbënd mooy barage wala digue bu dagg wala sunami.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nLénéne li meuna waral mbeund moy barage walla digue bou dag wala sunami.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2585,"row":{"en":"That's a good plan, Ms. Smith said. And be sure to drink plenty of water to stay hydrated.","wo":"Soxna Smith tontu ko, Noonu baaxna, te boole ci naan ndox mu bari balaa sa yaram di ñàkk ndox.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nSokhna Smith tontouko nonou bakhna té boolé thi nane ndokh mou bari bala sa yarame di niak ndokh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2586,"row":{"en":"The queue for the event was strangely small, so I released my parrot from the cage.","wo":"Raŋ bi nit ñi raŋ ngir xew-xew bi guddul woon noonu, ma bàyyi sama seku mu génn ci kaafam.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRan bi nitt gni ran nguir hew hew bi goudoul wone nonou ma bayi sama seku mou guenn si kafam\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2587,"row":{"en":"One day, George and Lennie find work on a ranch in California.","wo":"Benn bis, George ak Lennie am liggéey ci benn tool bu mag ci Californie.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn biss George ak Lennie am liguéy thi benn tool bou mague thi californie.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2588,"row":{"en":"You can turn every acquaintance into an asset if you know how to spin a thank-you letter.","wo":"Mën nga am cofeelu sa xameel bu nekk sudee xam nga ni ñuy bindee bataaxalu ngërëm bu baax.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nMeun nga ame cofeelou sa khameel bou neuk soudé kham nga ni gnuy bindé bataakhalou ngeureum bou bakh.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2589,"row":{"en":"He also studied at the London School of Economics and became a barrister.","wo":"Jàng na koom-koom itam ci daaray Londres mu dem ba nekk awokaa.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDiang na kom kom itam thi daaray londres mou dem ba nek avocat.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2590,"row":{"en":"The retina contains millions of light-sensitive cells called rods and cones.","wo":"Retine amna ay miliyaar ciy selil yu kapte leeraay ñu leen di waawe batone ak cone.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nRetine amna ay milliards thiy selil you kapte leeraay gnou len di waawé batone ak cone.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2591,"row":{"en":"The day of my driving test arrived, and I was more nervous than I had ever been in my life.","wo":"Bis bi may def examen dawal yegsi, waaye tiitaange gi ma àndaloon musu ma dal ci sama dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBiss bi may def examen dawal yegsi wayé tiitangé gui ma andalon mussouma dal si sama doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2592,"row":{"en":"The beauty of traditional dance forms lies in their simplicity, said the dancer.","wo":"Fecckat bi dafa wax Taaru xeeti peccum cosaan mingi ci seen yombaay.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nFeuthieukat bi dafa wakh taaru kheuti peuthieum cosaan mingui thi seen yombaay.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2593,"row":{"en":"One of her most famous paintings, The Death of My Son, is a stark and disturbing image of a young boy lying in a coffin.","wo":"Benn ci tabloom yi gëna siiw mooy, Faatug sama doom, di nataal bu neexul a xool, di wane xale bu tëdd ci keesu néew.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBenn thi tabloome yi geuna siw moy, Fatougue sama doom, di nataal bou neheul a khol, di wané khalé bou teudd thi késsou néw.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2594,"row":{"en":"Mary's shift in artistic style was not without its critics.","wo":"Bi Mary soppee ni muy defee art ñu bari dañu ko ŋàññi.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBi Mary soppé ni mouy défé art niou bari dagnou ko nani.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2595,"row":{"en":"He was kind, gentle, and he seemed to understand her in a way that no one else ever had.","wo":"Dafa baax, teey, ba noppi muy nuru kuko xam nuko keneen musul xamee noonu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDafa bakh tey ba nopi mouy nourou kouko kham niko kenen meussoul khamé nonou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2596,"row":{"en":"He started a very successful cycling holiday company and was part owner of a very busy bike shop.","wo":"Tambaliwonna benn kër liggey buy yengu ci ay vakans ci dawal welo yu mucc te nekkon kenn ci boromi kërub jaay welo.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nTambaliwone na bene keur liguey bouy yeungou si ay vacances si dawal welo you mouthie té nékone kene si boromi keurou diaay welo.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2597,"row":{"en":"Instead, she began to create dark, brooding works of art that reflected her inner turmoil.","wo":"Ci noonu mu tàmbale defar tablo art yu lëndëm, yu tiis ngir wane jafe-jafe yi muy dundu.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nThi nonou mou tambalé defar tableau art you leundeum, you tiiss nguir wané diafé diafé yi mouy doundou.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2598,"row":{"en":"The baby goat starts to emerge and I can see that it's a little girl.","wo":"Bëy wu ndaw wi tàmbali génn, ma gis ni bëy wu jigéen wu ndaw la.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nBeuy wou ndaw wi tambali guenn, ma guiss ni beuy wou djiguéne wou ndaw la.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]},{"row_idx":2599,"row":{"en":"It's not going to get you anywhere.","wo":"Du leen yóbbu fenn.","non_standardized":"<NON_STANDARD>\nDou len yobou fen.\n</NON_STANDARD>"},"truncated_cells":[]}],"num_rows_total":3438,"num_rows_per_page":100,"partial":false}